font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">학위 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">학사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">석사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">석사 통합</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">박사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">                 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">비학위 과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">헝가리어 준비과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-